# change.log

## [1.2.0] - 2026-11-20
### Added
- **Keynote Style Engine** (`scripts/build-video.mjs`, `scripts/audit-keynote.mjs`):
  - Supports `"style": "keynote"` in `script/scenes.json` (one idea per screen, max 6 words, accent word, full-bleed images, 22 drawn SVG visuals via `knVisual()`, word-timestamp LCS alignment via Whisper `*.transcript.json`, reading floor warnings, and generated speaker notes in `video/notes.md`).
  - Added `scripts/audit-keynote.mjs` headless-Chrome CDP auditor for Keynote rule compliance.
- **Music Bed Pipeline** (`scripts/gen-music.sh`, `scripts/mix-music.mjs`):
  - Generates an instrumental ACE-Step music bed via `fal.ai` and ducks it automatically under voiceover with swells in gaps and CTA.
  - `scripts/build-video.mjs` auto-mounts `video/assets/music/bed-mix.mp3` when present.
- **Interactive Review Hub, Compare Drafts, Renders & Performance Pages** (`scripts/build-review-page.mjs`, `scripts/build-compare-drafts-page.mjs`, `scripts/build-renders-page.mjs`, `scripts/build-first-draft-page.mjs`, `scripts/build-performance-page.mjs`, `scripts/render-draft.mjs`):
  - Upgraded `review.html` from a stub to the full frame-accurate video review workbench with drawing canvas, timestamped notes, verification carousel, Markdown/video export, and optional Azure Blob server-proxy sync.
  - Added `compare-drafts.html` (side-by-side synced dual player, A/B audio switcher, scene frame diffs, optional `draft/scores.json` ranking).
  - Added `renders.html`, `first-draft.html`, and `performance.html` with timed local pipeline metrics (`scripts/render-draft.mjs` -> `spec/performance.json`).
  - Added `scripts/lib/project.mjs` so all generators derive title, slug, repo, and version dynamically with zero hard-coded project values.
- **Secure Local Review Server** (`server.mjs`, `tests/server.test.mjs`, `tests/review-state.test.mjs`):
  - HTTP 206 Partial Content range streaming for MP4 scrubbing, automatic draft video fallback, CORS, server-proxy Azure drawing/verification endpoints (SAS never leaks to client), and dotfile/dot-folder blocking (`.env`, `.git`, `.hyperframes`).

### Fixed
- Removed duplicate lowercase `agents.md` that collided with `AGENTS.md` on case-insensitive filesystems (macOS).

## [1.1.0] - 2026-11-19
### Added
- **Bulk Setup Panel & Prompt Generator** (`panel/index.html`, `scripts/init-panel.mjs`):
  - Full bulk-intake form with identity (`video.yaml`), video format (`short`, `long`, `course`, `podcast`), target audience (`Consumer`, `Professional`, `Business`), owner (`Rifat Erdem Sahin`), Skool CTA default, `< $2.00` generation budget cap (`$1.50` default), `fal.ai` & `DeepInfra` API key intake (`.env`), Art Director defaults (visual style, sound/VO, BGM, SFX, backgrounds, green key, lower thirds, transitions), and draft script (`plan/outline.md`).
  - Live-updating **Role → Context → Constraints → Task** repo bootstrap prompt preview with one-click copy, `.md` download (`<slug>-initial-prompt.md`), and `localStorage` draft auto-save + reset.
- **Templated Review Website** (`index.html`, `site.css`, `nav.js`, `feedback.js`, `master-spec.html`, `script.html`, `review.html`, `kanban.html`, `publish.html`, `release-checklist.html`, `recommendations.html`, `agents.html`):
  - Shared sticky dropdown navigation, section-by-section collapsible feedback boxes, and GitHub Issue export.
  - Automatic placeholder replacement across all 19 template files via `scripts/fill-placeholders.mjs`.
- **Visual Storyboard Reviewer** (`scripts/build-storyboard.mjs`):
  - Generates `plan/storyboard.html` with scene cards, background previews, WPM pacing, and audio players; auto-built on GitHub Pages deploy (`.github/workflows/static.yml`).
- **A/B/C Thumbnails & Series Support**:
  - Added `thumbnails/thumb-b.html` (split-screen) and `thumbnails/thumb-c.html` (before/after) alongside `thumb-a.html`.
  - Added `scripts/new-episode.sh <slug>` for multi-video series under `videos/<slug>/`.
- **Style Presets & BGM Ducking** (`presets/style.json`, `presets/render.json`, `scripts/build-video.mjs`):
  - Extracted palette, fonts, and Art Director defaults into `presets/style.json`.
  - Added optional `bgm` track support with GSAP volume ducking during voiceover clips.
- **Automated Tests & Quality Evals** (`tests/template.test.mjs`, `tests/evals.mjs`, `package.json`):
  - Zero-dependency `node:test` integration suite testing JSON schemas, web pages, syntax, and end-to-end temp-copy scaffolding (`npm test`).
  - Objective quality eval scorecard checking budget cap, 8-layer Art Director defaults, RCCT prompt structure, timeline continuity, determinism, and version sync (`npm run eval`).
- **CI/CD Pre-Flight Gate** (`.github/workflows/check.yml`):
  - Automated script syntax checks, secret/media hygiene scan, end-to-end temp scaffolding test, and Hyperframes `npm run check`.

### Changed
- **Zero-`jq` & Cross-Platform Portability**:
  - Replaced `jq` in `scripts/render.sh`, `scripts/gen-backgrounds.sh`, and `scripts/gen-voiceover.sh` with Node.js.
  - Auto-detected Chrome/Chromium across Linux and macOS in `scripts/build-thumbnails.sh`.
  - Installed `gsap` locally in `video/package.json` for deterministic offline renders.
- **Automated YouTube Chapters & Pacing Linter**:
  - `scripts/retime.mjs` now exports formatted `mm:ss` chapters to `spec/publish.json`.
  - `scripts/validate.mjs` now checks speech rate (WPM) and overlay headline/line density.
- **Agent Documentation** (`AGENTS.md`, `agents.md`, `README.md`, `docs/RECOMMENDATIONS.md`):
  - Updated `AGENTS.md` (with `agents.md` symlink) with complete architecture, Hyperframes contract, and workflow lifecycle.

